# The build context is the repo. These are either large, machine-specific, or
# regenerated inside the image -- and a stale build tree copied in is the
# failure this project keeps finding.
.git
.github
results
**/build
**/target
**/obj
**/bin/Release
**/.build*
**/.lake
**/dist-newstyle
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/*.o
**/*.hi
**/*.cmi
**/*.cmx
# gfortran's module files, scoped to Fortran. Unscoped as `**/*.mod`
# this also matched impl/go/go.mod, so the image had every Go source
# file and no module definition -- one line of .dockerignore removing
# a language from the conformance gate.
impl/fortran/**/*.mod
docs/charts
